# RiskCore — Project Rules for AI Agents (Cline / OpenCode)

## Project Overview
Insurance microservices backend portfolio project. 4 Django microservices + Next.js 15 dashboard + Kafka event-driven architecture.

> 📍 **Read `CONTEXT.md` first** — it has the current project state, active phase, and next step.

**Full context in `CLAUDE.md`** — read it first every session.
- Business domain: `docs/GUIA_PROYECTO.md`
- Technical decisions: `docs/TECHNICAL_DECISIONS.md`
- API schemas: `docs/API_DESIGN.md`
- Dev phases: `docs/PHASES.md`

