## Tech Stack — Exact Versions

### Backend (per-service pyproject.toml)
- Python 3.13, **uv (latest stable)** — package manager, replaces pip/virtualenv/pip-tools entirely
- Django 5.2.x LTS, DRF 3.15.2
- **confluent-kafka 2.6.x** — never use kafka-python
- Celery 5.4.x + Redis 7.2.x
- PostgreSQL 16.x — one DB per service, never shared
- psycopg3 binary 3.3.x
- structlog 25.x for JSON logs, django-prometheus 0.3.x for metrics
- Django Channels 4.1.x + channels-redis 4.2.x
- **Ruff 0.15.x** — linting + formatting, replaces flake8/black/isort entirely
- mypy 1.20.x + django-stubs 6.0.x
- pytest 9.x + pytest-django 4.12.x + factory-boy

### Frontend
- Next.js 15.5.9 App Router, React 19, TypeScript 5.9.x
- **pnpm 10.24.0** — never npm or yarn
- Tailwind CSS 4.x, Radix UI, Zustand 5.x, Zod 4.x
- Vitest 4.x + Playwright 1.58.x

